{"text":"Just six months ago, the Tunisian Revolution began, leaving rapidly and inexorably to fundamental change across North Africa and the Middle East. Could this have happened without digital social media or without heightened correlation of food prices across time and space? Could this have happened just ten years ago with the same precondition but a different degree of connectivity? Can you imagine what the next ten years will bring? The next fifty? In the time before Princeton succumbed to Facebook, our world went through faces of transformation. And Harvard graduate students, faculty and commencement speakers have been key actors, writers, chronicles of those changes quite impactful on Africa. Some, like U.S. Secretary of State George Marshall, have stood in this very yard before graduating class such as yours to propose a massive post-World War II plan for Reconstruction.","words":[{"text":"Just","start":0.0,"end":0.98},{"text":"six","start":0.98,"end":1.26},{"text":"months","start":1.26,"end":1.52},{"text":"ago","start":1.52,"end":1.88,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":2.92,"end":2.94},{"text":"Tunisian","start":2.94,"end":3.48},{"text":"Revolution","start":3.48,"end":3.82},{"text":"began","start":3.82,"end":4.46,"punct":","},{"text":"leaving","start":5.24,"end":5.9},{"text":"rapidly","start":5.9,"end":6.5},{"text":"and","start":6.5,"end":6.72},{"text":"inexorably","start":6.72,"end":7.46},{"text":"to","start":7.46,"end":7.72},{"text":"fundamental","start":7.72,"end":8.28},{"text":"change","start":8.28,"end":8.94},{"text":"across","start":8.94,"end":9.36},{"text":"North","start":9.36,"end":9.64},{"text":"Africa","start":9.64,"end":10.08},{"text":"and","start":10.08,"end":10.26},{"text":"the","start":10.26,"end":10.36},{"text":"Middle","start":10.36,"end":10.48},{"text":"East","start":10.48,"end":10.98,"punct":"."},{"text":"Could","start":12.1,"end":12.2},{"text":"this","start":12.2,"end":12.4},{"text":"have","start":12.4,"end":12.62},{"text":"happened","s